<title>RUSSIA: Russian June inflation 1.1 pct vs 0.9 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Russian June inflation 1.1 pct vs 0.9 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's monthly consumer price inflation accelerated in June to 1.1 percent from 0.9 percent in May, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    June 97    May 97    June 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	+1.1	 +0.9	+1.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  n/a	  +14.6     +50.2</p>
<p>Consumer prices have risen by 8.6 percent since the start of the year, the Committee said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
